  "decisions": [
    "Restored complete English subjects in the sampled Looks like lines at 389:t_1:18, 438:t_006:1, 431:t_1:87; translators broadened their own sweeps.",
    "450:t_021:3 restored subject and copula in the response to the ominous beginning-of-the-end question.",
    "474:t_015:1 strengthened send you on your way to finish you off: adjacent still alive and killing-blow lines establish a death threat.",
    "455:t_1:12 retains passive protection promise because 455:t_1:14 explicitly rules out Cayenne himself as protector.",
    "426:t_100:4 teacher-attraction subject remains an explicitly flagged contextual interpretation; no definitive independent resolution claimed.",
    "431:t_1:131 immediate Maki goodbye supports her; 432:t_004:4 aura reading follows the next line sensing hatred; 432:t_038:0 insufficient thing remains unspecified.",
    "467:t_1 unnamed sender kept neutral in early scene. Later 468:t_000:3 and 468:t_001:0-1 identify Advent and confirm the message; no Tetsuya inference retained.",
    "390:t_020:1 Holstein/buffalo bust joke retained indirectly. Akagi/red ink and AG mi/body-gai/shell jokes remain editorial review points.",
    "467:t_10:19 decorative source glyph is represented by flirtatious ASCII delivery; font-specific rendering has not been checked in-game.",
    "Clarification to agent 1 report: the short interface-title note labeled 389:t_2:31 concerns Chamber at 389:t_2:30. Striker at row 31 uses the full Human Race Support and Enlightenment Regulation System term.",
